{"id":"9a4f932ed500c2b4","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-projective-hierarchy.md","title":"Strict Projective Levels on Baire Space","display":"thm-projective-hierarchy — Strict Projective Levels on Baire Space","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-projective-hierarchy","aliases":["68-thm-projective-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-projective-hierarchy — Strict Projective Levels on Baire Space","depends_on":["[[68-thm-projective-enumeration]]","[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§20 p.76 / PDF 85, exercise following 20.1","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"local-diagonal-proof-reviewed; source-exercise","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-projective-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-projective-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-projective-hierarchy — Strict Projective Levels on Baire Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc4e938a01248a42\" href=\"?note=cc4e938a01248a42\" title=\"68-thm-projective-enumeration\">68-thm-projective-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ebe52081fac785e\" href=\"?note=0ebe52081fac785e\" title=\"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure\">68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§20 p.76 / PDF 85, exercise following 20.1"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-diagonal-proof-reviewed; source-exercise"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 和正层级投射类沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc4e938a01248a42\" href=\"?note=cc4e938a01248a42\" title=\"68-thm-projective-enumeration\">68-thm-projective-enumeration</a> 的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{1,0}\">\\(X_{1,0}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\langle\\alpha\\rangle,())\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\">\\((\\langle\\alpha\\rangle,())\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\)</span> 识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(1,0)}\\setminus\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(1,0)}\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(1,0)}\\setminus\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(1,0)}\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(1,0)}\\setminus\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(1,0)}\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(1,0)}\\setminus\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(1,0)}\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书把此结果留作练习；以下给本地推导。取 20.1 的无参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^1\">\\(\\Pi_n^1\\)</span> 通用二实关系 Q，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{\\alpha:(\\alpha,\\alpha)\\notin Q\\}\">\\(D=\\{\\alpha:(\\alpha,\\alpha)\\notin Q\\}\\)</span>。递归对角代入和补集闭包给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1\">\\(D\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1\">\\(D\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1\\)</span>，则有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow Q(\\alpha,\\beta)\">\\(D(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow Q(\\alpha,\\beta)\\)</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\beta\">\\(\\alpha=\\beta\\)</span> 得矛盾。补集给出另一方向的见证。见证在 Baire 空间上；不对纯自然数关系作这一严格性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-thm-projective-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"cc4e938a01248a42","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure","status":"resolved","id":"0ebe52081fac785e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-projective-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"cc4e938a01248a42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$\\mathcal B$ 和正层级投射类沿用 [[68-thm-projective-enumeration]] 的定义。$X_{1,0}$ 与 $\\mathcal B$ 通过 $(\\langle\\alpha\\rangle,())\\leftrightarrow\\alpha$ 识别。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X_{1,0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"(\\langle\\alpha\\rangle,())\\leftrightarrow\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(1,0)}\\setminus\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(1,0)}\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^{1,(1,0)}\\setminus\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^{1,(1,0)}\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_n^1","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\{\\alpha:(\\alpha,\\alpha)\\notin Q\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_n^1","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi_n^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"D(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow Q(\\alpha,\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\beta","display":false}],"bytes":1628,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-hierarchy]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-projective-hierarchy|thm-projective-hierarchy — Strict Projective Levels on Baire Space]]"}],"outgoing":["cc4e938a01248a42","0ebe52081fac785e"]}